Package: importABCatlas
Title: Release-Aware Access to Allen Brain Cell Atlas Data in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Uday", "Rangaswamy",  role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "uday.rangaswamy@ieo.it"),
    person("Federico", "Caretti", role = c("aut")))
Description: Provides an R-native, release-aware interface to the Allen Brain
    Cell (ABC) Atlas. Discovers supported dataset routes, assembles validated
    cell and gene metadata, selects exact or sampled cell populations, plans
    expression requests before transfer, and reads selected H5AD expression
    directly in R. Expression can be returned as a sparse matrix bundle or,
    when optional packages are installed, as a Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment, or SpatialExperiment object. The package preserves
    source representation and provenance, distinguishes raw counts from
    upstream transformed or imputed expression, and requires no Python
    installation.
